# Android SDK Platform-Tools (adb.exe + support DLLs) — NOT bundled
# in the repo. The official package is covered by Google's Android
# SDK License Agreement, which forbids redistributing the package
# itself, so contributors download it manually into Tools\ —
# see README "Building from source" section.
